 363+ 7DEB 21 00 7A         LD HL, TilePalette0
 364+ 7DEE
 365+ 7DEE              ; write palette data, 2 bytes per colour
 366+ 7DEE              tilemapPalette0Loop:
 367+ 7DEE 7E               LD A, (HL)
 368+ 7DEF 23               INC HL
 369+ 7DF0 ED 92 44         NEXTREG $44, A
