 328+ 830F                      ; ----------------------------------------------------------------------------
 329+ 830F                      ; we've popped a tile of the queue (having previously processed it)
 330+ 830F                      ; now we want to look at it's neighbours, i.e. x-1, y; x+1, y; x, y-1; x, y+1
