 513+ 8408              ; buildMapImage - render the whole 256x192 map into Layer 2
 514+ 8408              ;
 515+ 8408              ; Optimised: the slot-6 page offset (y/32) and the in-page
 516+ 8408              ; address high byte ((y&$1F)|$C0) are constant for a whole row,
 517+ 8408              ; so they are computed ONCE per row. Columns are walked with
