 184+ 87BC CB 3C       >        srl h                                       ; divide by 2
 184+ 87BE CB 1D       >        rr l
 184+ 87C0 CB 3C       >        srl h                                       ; divide by 4
 184+ 87C2 CB 1D       >        rr l
 184+ 87C4 CB 3C       >        srl h                                       ; divide by 8
 184+ 87C6 CB 1D       >        rr l
